Booster Robotics T2 (T2_31dof) description assets.

Source: Booster Robotics T2 robot description (`T2_31dof.xml`, `T2_31dof.urdf`
and `meshes/`), vendored unmodified except for the MJCF edits documented at the
top of ``t2.xml``.  The mesh binaries in ``assets/`` are byte-identical copies of
the upstream ``meshes/`` directory.

Redistributed here under the same terms as the other Booster description assets
already vendored in this repository (see
``src/mjlab/asset_zoo/robots/booster_t1/xmls/LICENSE``, Apache License 2.0).
No upstream LICENSE file accompanied the T2 drop that was handed to us; if the
vendor ships one, replace this file with it verbatim.
